BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Juicy Queer Night
DTSTART:20260512T170000
DTEND:20260512T170000
UID:a80a0e948ef2180cb48dcbddd11d45ff@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:JUICY 💔🍷 the final night After 2.5 years… we’re sayi
 ng goodbye. Juicy was never just a party. It was a meeting place. A soft p
 lace. A safer space! A room where queer people could gather\, enjoy wine a
 nd banter\, snacks and sips! We’ve flirted in corners\, cried in bathroo
 ms\, made friends at the bar\, shared stories over glasses\, and watched t
 his space fill again and again with something you can’t manufacture: que
 er joy. Holding this night\, over and over\, has been one of the great hon
 ours of my life. I am moving out of the city and who knows if a juicy will
  pop up down the road! Thank you for showing up. Thank you for trusting th
 e space. Thank you for making it what it became. Let’s gather one last t
 ime\, to toast it\, to feel it\, to say goodbye properly. Tuesday\, May 12
  Paradise Grapevine (Bloor) 5 ‘til late Happy hour 5–6 snacks\, chats\
 , laughs\, come say goodbye\, come be Juicy one last time 💫 ‍
LOCATION:Paradise Grapevine on Bloor\, 841 Bloor St W
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/juicy-queer-night-11
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Repeat: A Queer &quot\;Book Club&quot\; for Albums!
DTSTART:20260512T190000
DTEND:20260512T190000
UID:96066ee34fd0eeb150d5c79b48b730bc@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Repeat is a new queer social night &amp\; drag show for music 
 lovers...imagine a book club\, but for albums! May 12th Album: Wor$t Girl 
 in America Ever wanted to join a book club\, but you don’t like reading?
  Ever listened to an album and wanted to talk about it for hours\, but had
  no one to gab with? REPEAT is for you! Each month\, we pick a new album t
 o break down- this month&#x27\;s album is Wor$t Girl in America by Slayyyt
 er. We’ll chat about it\, do some music trivia\, play some games\, watch
  some performances of select songs by host Matte Black and decide…IS THI
 S ALBUM ON REPEAT?? Take a look at the pinned post at @repeattoronto on IG
  for more deets and FAQs!! This month\, we&#x27\;ll have special giveaways
  from Dead Dog Records and more! See you there 😍😍😍 ‍
LOCATION:Mama&#x27\;s Liquor and Lounge\, 1602 Dundas Street West
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/repeat-a-queer-book-club-for-albums
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
