BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Questionable - SAPPHIC EDITION : Queer Singles Trivia
DTSTART:20260514T193000
DTEND:20260514T193000
UID:0c91a81a44f1777c3cc9ea85667082cf@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Gay trivia served with a side of CHAOS. Is Toronto a tough pla
 ce to meet new people? Tired of the apps? Try this! Q UESTIONABLE is trivi
 a with a twist…. This is our SAPPHIC EDITION. Always trans and enby incl
 usive. Already have what you&#x27\;re looking for but have a friend who yo
 u want to set up? Come pitch them! Come be part of the series that has bec
 ome the stuff of legends..... This event is at GROUND CONTROL 1279 Queen S
 treet West Doors at 7:30pm First Round starts at 8pm Hosted by your faves:
  @chaodykes How does it work? You will be put in a team with 5-6 people yo
 u don’t know. There will be 2 rounds of trivia. Each round\, you will ch
 ange teams! So\, by the end of the event you will have met 10-12 new peopl
 e. Each round lasts about 40 minutes - just long enough to get to know som
 eone’s vibe but not so long you are stuck with them all night! There wil
 l be a DJ In the lounge after the event so you can stay after the event to
  keep the conversations going! What does ‘single’ mean? &#x27\;Single
 ’ means you are open to connecting with other people for love\, lust or 
 friendship. Maybe you will meet your soulmate! Maybe you will meet your ne
 w best friend! Maybe you will make out in the bathroom! Maybe you will add
  a lover to your rotation! Maybe you will find a gaming parter! Basically 
 - you should be available to connect with people in some way. The event is
  poly-friendly\, slut-friendly\, monogamy-friendly\, ace-friendly. If you 
 can’t leave your judgment of others at home\, then you should stay home.
  Schedule 7:30pm - Doors Open\, you get put into your first team 8pm - Fir
 st Round starts 10pm - Expected end\, but you can stay to socialize! Cost 
 We are doing a sliding scale of $7-$25. All funds are going to Glad Day Li
 t to support 2SLGBTQ artists and community events. How will you make the t
 eams? The teams will mostly be random. How many people can attend? Our max
  number for this event is 85 people.This event can sell out and the lower 
 price tickets sell out first\, so act fast. You can email any questions to
  have to: vip@gladday.ca ‍
LOCATION:Ground Control\, 1279 Queen St W
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/questionable---sapphic-edition-queer-singl
 es-trivia-10
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
