SUMMARY:Learn to Play Dungeons and Dragons
DTSTART:20260517T180000
DTEND:20260517T180000
UID:f0883f2bbb62a9b11bb4bf30749fac77@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Here&#x27\;s the Link to RSVP: https://forms.gle/teTXpgVVscvLa
 xnp7 ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~ Learn to Play Dungeons and Dr
 agons Quest Log: When: May 17th\, 6PM - 9PM Where: Three Dollar Bill Bar\,
  1592 Queen St W\, Parkdale\, Toronto M6R 1A8 Who: You! Bring 1 friend Cos
 t: Free Masked event ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~ Rol
 l for Initiative... on Making Friends! URGENT QUEST ALERT Calling all Tran
 s and Sapphic Adventurers! The guild master at Three Dollar Bill seeks bra
 ve souls on the 3rd Sunday of the month for an epic gathering. Whether you
 &#x27\;re a seasoned dungeon delver or have never touched a d20\, your par
 ty needs YOU! Quest Details: Learn to Play Dungeons &amp\; Dragons - New t
 o the realm? No problem! We&#x27\;ll cover the basics: What even is D&amp\
 ;D? How do you craft a legendary backstory? What do all those numbers on t
 he character sheet mean? Quick Questing: Party Finder Speed Sessions - Thi
 nk speed dating\, but for finding your forever D&amp\;D group! Match play 
 styles\, align schedules\, and find your people to start your own home cam
 paigns. Because the real treasure is the shenanigan&#x27\;s your party got
  to along the way. (ﮧOﮧ) Karaoke Finale - End the night sharing harrow
 ing tales and singing bardic ballads in the tavern! Whether you&#x27\;re a
  Bard from the College of Info-Dump\, a Dice Goblin with a hoard to rival 
 a dragon&#x27\;s\, or someone on their fifth playthrough of Baldur&#x27\;s
  Gate 3 (we see you\, we respect you) this is YOUR space! Meet fellow nerd
 s who GET IT\, debate which class is the most OP\, and vibe with people wh
 o understand that &quot\;just one more campaign&quot\; is a lifestyle. All
  skill levels welcome No gatekeeping allowed. Bring your favorite dice (or
  borrow ours)! Your journey to forge new friendships starts here! May your
  rolls be high and your hit points higher! Adventure awaits! ‍
LOCATION:Three Dollar Bill\, 1592 Queen Street West
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/learn-to-play-dungeons-and-dragons
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
