DESCRIPTION:Friday May 29: DAVID TORT [Extended Set] TAKiN | Junior Lopez 
 | Chris Campos Spain’s tribal house powerhouse David Tort returns to Wig
 gle Room for a night that hits different. After tearing up the dancefloor 
 last year and feeling the raw energy of Wiggle Room\, David went back to t
 he studio inspired—and now he’s bringing that energy full circle. Join
  us for the official release party of his brand new track on Wiggle Room R
 ecords\, a deeply personal tribute crafted straight from the heart\, dedic
 ated to the unforgettable vibe of our home\, Wiggle Room. This isn’t jus
 t another booking—this is a moment. A connection between artist and danc
