 , Two-Spirit\, non-binary and otherwise gender nonconforming folx. Cis men
  are not permitted to attend.) Come play at the Birdhaus! There will be so
 me organized activities to provide opportunities to get involved and try n
 ew things including: naked tarot readings\, a (staffed) spanking booth\, w
 ax play station\, spin the bottle\, simple rope demo\, crafts and more! Th
 ere will also be lots of opportunity to do your own thing\, socialize\, or
  just observe. All forms of play including impact\, rope\, needles\, wax\,
  etc are welcome. Bring your implements and toys! There will be a mix of c
 omfy seating as well as play areas with equipment such as spanking benches
 \, massage tables\, St Andrew’s Crosses\, Hard Points\, a confession boo
 th and more. Although the party is sex positive\, it is not a sex party as
  the Birdhaus is not set up to accommodate all the fluids. BYO Drop sheet 
 if you are planning to engage in sex or messy play. Snacks will be provide
 d and the bar will be open selling alcoholic and non-alcoholic drinks. Con
 sider bringing your own water bottle to decrease waste. Enthusiastic conse
 nt and respect for all identities and boundaries are non‑negotiable. Com
 munity guidelines will be reviewed at the door. DMs will be monitoring the
  space. Please stay home if you’re sick. This event welcomes all women\,
  trans\, Two-Spirit\, non-binary and otherwise gender nonforming folx (19+
 ). Cis men are not permitted to attend. ACCESSIBILITY: The Birdhaus has tw
 o levels. The main level is accessible from the sidewalk and has an access
 ible bathroom\, the lower level is accessed only by stairs. The entrance t
 o the Birdhaus is off of Gwynne Ave\, just South of Queen st. ‍
